<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Careless Kind</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Yours Truly</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">is this what i look like?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0blYEeiMjo0T0syhIyh7m1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.700" end="00:06.530">You don't know who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.530" end="00:10.150">I got these ankle scars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.150" end="00:12.500">Still wanna cover up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.500" end="00:17.720">I know I shouldn't give a-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.720" end="00:21.420">And fuck your everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.420" end="00:25.250">It's temporary that way (it's temporary that way)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.250" end="00:27.420">I know I'm getting close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.420" end="00:30.060">I'm like a supernova</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.060" end="00:37.300">I'd like to say I've learnt all that I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.300" end="00:45.300">If I can't see me, my reflections gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.490" end="00:48.850">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.850" end="00:52.480">See it in black and white</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.480" end="00:54.990">A little more careless kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.990" end="00:56.550">'Cause it's always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.550" end="00:58.050">Just me and my doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.840" end="01:00.440">Keep it falling out, keep it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.440" end="01:03.840">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.840" end="01:07.440">Read it between the lines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.440" end="01:09.980">A little more careless kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.980" end="01:11.480">'Cause it's always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.440" end="01:12.940">Just me and my doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.810" end="01:17.170">Keep it falling out, keep it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.170" end="01:20.930">My body's just a house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.930" end="01:24.620">And all the lights arе out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.620" end="01:27.040">Dust on the surface and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.040" end="01:29.460">Everything's so ovеrgrown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.460" end="01:36.870">I'd like to say I've learnt all that I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.870" end="01:44.870">If I can't see me, my reflection's gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.990" end="01:48.380">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.380" end="01:52.020">See it in black and white</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.020" end="01:54.520">A little more careless kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.520" end="01:56.020">'Cause it's always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.980" end="01:57.580">Just me and my doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.580" end="01:59.800">Keep it falling out, keep it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.800" end="02:03.400">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.400" end="02:07.160">Read it between the lines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.160" end="02:09.440">A little more careless kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.440" end="02:11.060">'Cause it's always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.060" end="02:12.560">Just me and my doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.420" end="02:14.650">Keep it falling out, keep it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.650" end="02:18.460">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.460" end="02:22.180">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.180" end="02:25.770">If I could change my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.770" end="02:29.250">A little more careless kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.250" end="02:33.250" /></div></body></tt>